ubles as a fist?), our hero vows to turn the game’s unluckiest loser into its mightiest heartthrob. In this world, nothing is out of reach when you’ve got the know-how!\n\n\n\n(Source: Yen Press)\n\n\n\nNote: Each episode streamed 1 week early on ABEMA and d anime store. The original TV broadcast started on October 4th, 2026."],"ja":["マジカル★エクスプローラー　エロゲの友人キャラに転生したけど、ゲーム知識使って自由に生きる",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-78506":"2026-10-21T14:53:04Z","serial-78448":"2026-10-20T19:53:17Z","serial-78532":"2026-10-18T19:41:29Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-78506","serial-78448","serial-78532"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":6.9}]}